::Q1::Which of the following best describes a Public Cloud?
{
    = Cloud infrastructure owned and managed by a third-party provider and delivered over the internet
    ~ Cloud infrastructure used by only one organization within its premises
    ~ A combination of on-premise and local servers only
    ~ A private network with no internet connectivity
}

::Q2::What is a key characteristic of a Private Cloud?
{
    ~ It is shared by multiple organizations over the internet
    = It is dedicated to a single organization
    ~ It is always hosted by AWS
    ~ It does not provide scalability
}

::Q3::Why do organizations use a Hybrid Cloud model?
{
    ~ To completely avoid public cloud services
    = To combine benefits of both public and private cloud environments
    ~ To eliminate internet usage
    ~ To reduce hardware to zero
}
